  "notes": [
    "B r=3: no reply within 1500 ms",
    "B r=7: no reply within 1500 ms",
    "B sends, in order: q /bad.path; q /bad#x; q /x {l:\"abc\",vf:\"l\"} t1; {l:1,vf:\"z\"} t2; {l:-1,vf:\"l\"} t3; {i:\"$bad\"} t4; {sp:1,sin:\"yes\",i:\".key\"} t5; q /x with q:{} and t 8; n /nolisten; n /x tagged t9 never listened; n /bad.path.",
    "Duplicates: B q /dup twice (untagged), q /dup {l:1,vf:\"l\"} t11 twice; A p /dup/0 0 (sorts first, enters t11 window); B n /dup once; A p /dup/00 0; B n t11 once; A p /dup/0 1 (a change inside the t11 window); B n /dup again; B n t11 again; A p /dup/0 2.",
    "Then C (fresh socket): q /x with t:7 but no q; A p /x/y 2. D (fresh socket): q /x with q {l:1,vf:\"l\"} but no t. E1, E2, ... (fresh sockets, 2 s apart, until one stays open): g /dup.",
